msgstr "SERIAL2 -> UART2（TMAVLink）（已连接内部蓝牙模块，ArduPilot 不可用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:69
#: 4f3b6668cdb94b15a217f1d9d0f0ef00
msgid "SERIAL3 -> UART3 (RCinput)(DMA Capable)"
msgstr "SERIAL3 -> UART3（RC 输入）（支持 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:70
#: 9226b077c0624ebea9bcee14ab70c234
msgid "SERIAL4 -> UART4 (GPS)"
msgstr "SERIAL4 -> UART4（GPS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:71
#: a2cbdee2832c4b0896fd0905d6c2a8b7
msgid "SERIAL5 -> not available"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> 不可用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:72
#: ff045a6fdd4c40b3b21716d7878949f9
msgid "SERIAL6 -> UART6 (MAVLink2)"
msgstr "SERIAL6 -> UART6（MAVLink2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:73
#: 1d758509f92d4a3f97ebf3ca7285277a
msgid "SERIAL7 -> UART7 (RX7 only available, ESC telemetry)(DMA Capable)"
msgstr "SERIAL7 -> UART7（仅 RX7 可用，ESC 数传）（支持 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:75
#: 872da30866d74cb092530ef60477762e
msgid ""
"The SERIAL7 port (UART7) is normally for ESC telemetry, and has an R7 pin on"
" both of the ESC connectors."
msgstr "SERIAL7 端口（UART7）通常用于 ESC 数传，两个 ESC 连接器上均有 R7 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:80
#: af9f6287ee764e14975eaf5674dc9172
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:82
#: b821f58f12784e23863fbd7b91b123ff
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R3 (UART3_RX) pin for unidirectional "
"protocols. The T3 pin must also be used for bi-directional protocols, such "
"as CRSF/ELRS."
msgstr "单向协议的 RC 输入配置在 R3（UART3_RX）引脚上。双向协议（如 CRSF/ELRS）还需使用 T3 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:84
#: 8f983eb0808d4d7f8c7f38574c9a0858
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:86
#: ed67793a786d447fab8f38b40f53af24
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R3 pin"
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接至 R3 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:88
#: 71f65e73e8e4456286a2e8009d25d57b
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T3 and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需连接至 T3，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:90
#: 99dff63f04734e088f883833e5362e56
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T3 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 R6 外还需要 T3 连接，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` 设为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:92
#: 20cb0aec8bfb415aab68dcb743aefadc
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T6 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接至 T6 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:94
#: 2d49860452564583b94f95d270fd6f94
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details. CRSF/ELRS requires full DMA for maximum reliability."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中任意 UART 均可用于 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详见 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。CRSF/ELRS 需要完整 DMA 支持以获得最高可靠性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:97
#: b3b00d5f506840eab0dd2f0f2da7fe35
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:99
#: fbd0b5ae53274253bc89bd1e423e2ce1
msgid ""
"The SDMODELH7V2  supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). Simultaneous DisplayPort OSD option is also available and SERIAL1 "
"defaults to DisplayPort protocol."
msgstr ""
"SDMODELH7V2 支持使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。同时还支持 "
"DisplayPort OSD，SERIAL1 默认使用 DisplayPort 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:102
#: ec6c64b2ba0c40f1a91cbae916d251e9
msgid "VTX Power Switch"
msgstr "VTX 电源开关"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:104
#: 2029881139194b8e956b1b0e032cfc04
msgid ""
"The JST-GH-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection. Pin 1 of "
"the connector is 9v so be careful not to connect this to a peripheral "
"requiring 5v. The 9v supply is controlled by RELAY_PIN2 set to GPIO 81 and "
"is on by default. It can be configured to be operated by an RC switch by "
"selecting the function RELAY2."
msgstr ""
"JST-GH-6P 连接器支持标准 DJI HD VTX 连接。连接器第 1 引脚为 9V，请勿将其连接至需要 5V 的外设。9V 电源由 "
"RELAY_PIN2（GPIO 81）控制，默认开启。可通过将功能设为 RELAY2 来由 RC 开关控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:107
#: c05f6e0e132c4cd392323655e914efa5
msgid "Camera Control Pin"
msgstr "摄像头控制引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:109
#: b64fb8d2529647feb5d8cb2d1dbc57b7
msgid ""
"The Cam pin is GPIO 84 and is set to be controlled by RELAY4 by default. "
"Relay pins can be controlled either by an RC switch or GCS command. See "
":ref:`common-relay` for more information."
msgstr ""
"Cam 引脚为 GPIO 84，默认由 RELAY4 控制。继电器引脚可通过 RC 开关或 GCS 命令控制。详见 :ref:`common-"
"relay`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:112
#: 6df64f1d04de420ab1be117cf997f3fb
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:114
#: f10744c299a74abea6f98444cbc16f91
msgid ""
"The SDMODELH7V2 supports up to 8 PWM outputs. Outputs are available via two "
"JST-SH connectors. All 8 outputs support DShot as well as all PWM types. "
"Ouputs 1-4 also support Bi-Directional DSHOT."
msgstr ""
"SDMODELH7V2 最多支持 8 路 PWM 输出，通过两个 JST-SH 连接器引出。所有 8 路输出均支持 DShot 及各类 PWM "
"类型。输出 1-4 还支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:116
#: 1537a88e20914ac5975232e3e12ab4ca
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:118
#: a898575f628646ac9b4397711a27d596
msgid "PWM 1, 2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 为第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:119
#: 707fe66a2c8d458784fe6b389984e45a
msgid "PWM 3, 4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3、4 为第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:120
#: bea9c3d16e61479198c51c7d010dd6ab
msgid "PWM 5, 6 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5、6 为第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:121
#: c03da71b743a478a9e2b65605c0ebc3b
msgid "PWM 7, 8 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7、8 为第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:122
#: 80dfdf2369684532a9d6d7dd277a4800
msgid "PWM 9(LED) in group5"
msgstr "PWM 9（LED）为第 5 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:124
#: 09b6ab867b3b41c08d2a1e96d5ad2d6d
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM"
" or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同组内的通道必须使用相同的输出频率（PWM 或 DShot）。若某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:128
#: 2dc9065d256f4a14bcff68afee09dcf6
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从 BetaflightX 四轴迁移过来的用户，前四路输出 M1-M4 已通过以下默认参数配置为与现有电机接线兼容："

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:130
#: 9fedfd13376c476cbd74bfdb068f6c38
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四轴）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:131
#: 50426aadd2cd4b49816b0b427d141320
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:134
#: aa0d4bf8a01a41d68bbfc7034b08c06a
msgid "LED Output"
msgstr "LED 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:136
#: 416e05482c584ef89546a39ae310dab6
msgid ""
"The LED output (PWM9) is configured by default to support :ref:`NeoPixel LED"
" strings<common-serial-led-neopixel>`."
msgstr ""
"LED 输出（PWM9）默认配置为支持 :ref:`NeoPixel LED 灯带<common-serial-led-neopixel>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:139
#: f5d1e74d2dea49d0aa8118f197bb9461
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:141
#: cd15317d49cd40e4a2b7ce6dda6674a3
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor via the B+ pin, but no internal "
"current sensor. An external current sensor can be connected to the CUR pin. "
"Default parameters for both internal voltage and external current monitoring"
" are set by default to the below for use with any Holybro Tekko32 F4 4in1 "
"ESC."
msgstr ""
"该板通过 B+ 引脚内置电压传感器，但无内部电流传感器。外部电流传感器可连接至 CUR 引脚。内部电压和外部电流监测的默认参数已预设，适用于 "
"Holybro Tekko32 F4 4合1 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:143
#: be8b35356d944fff8a97e18f0af02857
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:145
#: cb3987c0eec644128eeaf3e3ae904636
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:146
#: e0566bc864f24c9793b73d190f37343d
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:147
#: 78f98ef1489749818b612b9b61c9617d
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:148
#: 3c4e6633700a4c03a777afd0ac4e5490
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:149
#: e55575153ac449098945895d8ce47d0b
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 59.5"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 59.5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:152
#: ffc666f7170d4c64bf65cbe55fa4026a
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:154
#: e0acbacc3e934499b11576962f661688
msgid ""
"The SDMODELH7V2 has a built-in compass. However, often motor/battery current"
" interference can be too high on small vehicles to adequately calibrate the "
"compass and it may be disabled using :ref:`COMPASS_USE<COMPASS_USE>` = 0, an"
" you can attach an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr ""
"SDMODELH7V2 内置罗盘。但在小型机体上，电机/电池电流干扰可能过高，导致罗盘无法正常校准，可通过设置 "
":ref:`COMPASS_USE<COMPASS_USE>` = 0 禁用内置罗盘，并通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘以 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:157
#: 78c6efa6f375489a867cd45be544ccfd
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:159
#: f558016a5f754946bc5d4192b0730829
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"SDMODELH7V2\"."
msgstr ""
"该板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的 「SDMODELH7V2」 子目录中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:162
#: bcedad884d06429bb0d8fd921be34757
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SDMODELH7V2.rst:164
#: 9ce1f47e503848f4809330a4618c60ea
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"初始固件可通过 DFU 方式加载：按住引导程序按钮的同时插入 USB。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 工具加载 「with_bl.hex」 固件。"

